        "answer": "Samah can professionally help with designing and building production-ready AI solutions, backend systems, and modern full-stack web applications, specializing in AI/LLM integration, workflow automation, and interactive frontend delivery. Additionally, Samah offers technical leadership, including translating business requirements, leading development initiatives, and coordinating project delivery.\n\nKey points:\n- Samah can build AI-powered chatbots, RAG-based question-answering systems, and LLM-based information extraction tools.\n- Samah develops dashboard and analytics platforms, including monitoring dashboards with alerts and forecasts.\n- Samah can create document analysis, OCR systems, and classification/recommendation engines for business data.\n- Samah can build business portals with authentication and role-based permissions, and API-first platforms integrated with modern web frontends.\n- Samah can construct end-to-end web applications using Django backend and Next.js frontend.\n- Samah provides support for junior developers and guidance on implementation direction.",
