        "retrieval_query": "What can Samah do?",
        "rewrite_notes": "local_fast_path",
        "verdict": "supported",
        "answer": "Samah can build a wide range of AI-powered applications, including backend APIs, intelligent automation workflows, dashboards, chatbots, document-processing solutions, and modern web platforms. She is also capable of building full-stack applications and Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) systems.\n\nKey points:\n- Samah works directly with customers and stakeholders to gather requirements, present solutions, and translate needs into technical systems.\n- She excels at solving business problems by automating manual workflows, turning unstructured data into useful structured outputs, and connecting AI with business operations.\n- Samah can build interactive dashboards and data-driven business systems for monitoring, analytics, reporting, and decision support.\n- Her experience includes working with OCR and document-processing tools such as Tesseract, EasyOCR, OpenCV, and LLM-based extraction workflows.\n- Samah has experience with AI and LLM technologies including Hugging Face Transformers, BERT, RoBERTa, T5, Gemini, Ollama, LangChain, embeddings, vector search, and prompt engineering.\n- She can build various types of chatbots, such as document-grounded chatbots, intelligent assistants, conversational search tools, and business workflow chatbots.",
